WEBVTT

00:36.619 --> 00:39.706
20 YEARS AGO

00:41.624 --> 00:43.293
My lady…

00:45.628 --> 00:47.505
My lady…

00:56.181 --> 00:57.724
My lady…

01:01.644 --> 01:03.772
I shall make Do-hwa mine.

01:03.855 --> 01:06.483
If she bears a child,
know that it is mine.

01:12.530 --> 01:14.282
My lady…

01:15.200 --> 01:16.534
My lord.

01:16.618 --> 01:18.203
Where are you going, my lord?

01:28.880 --> 01:30.590
I heard about Do-hwa.

01:31.174 --> 01:32.801
We were just about to head over.

01:32.884 --> 01:36.805
Why are you here
when you should be mourning her?

01:37.514 --> 01:40.558
I came here because this was
the only way to change his fate.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.121
What are you doing?

02:27.230 --> 02:29.149
What have you done?

02:29.232 --> 02:31.276
I have blocked his gate of energy.

02:32.110 --> 02:34.571
He will not be able
to learn any spells while he is alive.

02:37.740 --> 02:41.161
I forbid anyone from opening
his gate of energy!

02:41.911 --> 02:45.915
How could you do this to your son?

02:47.834 --> 02:49.043
My son?

02:58.344 --> 03:00.513
Why would he decide my own fate?

03:01.806 --> 03:04.017
No one even considers him
as my true father anyway!

03:04.809 --> 03:05.977
I will find someone.

03:06.603 --> 03:08.438
A master who will open my gate of energy

03:08.521 --> 03:10.523
and teach me how to practice spells.

03:11.482 --> 03:13.318
I will find someone myself.

03:14.569 --> 03:17.030
Then I will take out that sword
and break it in two.

03:22.201 --> 03:26.039
I have met a total of 12 masters
and have been kicked out every time.

03:27.832 --> 03:31.252
And finally, I have met the master
who will change my fate.

03:42.889 --> 03:44.724
I knew the moment I saw you.

03:46.476 --> 03:47.852
You are my master.

03:58.738 --> 04:02.283
Did you find something special about me,

04:02.367 --> 04:03.409
Young Master?

04:06.371 --> 04:08.248
I told you that you have beautiful eyes.

04:08.331 --> 04:10.667
Right, sorry.
Only your eyes are beautiful.

04:12.335 --> 04:14.837
The soul shifter's blue mark
has bloomed inside them.

04:16.589 --> 04:18.508
So the mark was inside my eyes.

04:22.887 --> 04:24.180
You are going to fight me?

04:24.264 --> 04:25.974
Killing you would be a breeze.

04:26.557 --> 04:27.850
But this is Songrim.

04:28.601 --> 04:30.019
You will get caught.

04:42.532 --> 04:44.617
I am planning to save you.

04:44.701 --> 04:47.745
You will not get caught
if you stay by my side.

05:01.718 --> 05:03.928
How should you address me
if you want to lie low?

05:06.431 --> 05:07.724
"Young Master."

05:20.903 --> 05:21.904
Jang Uk?

05:22.572 --> 05:23.781
Yes, it is me.

05:24.282 --> 05:25.742
Why are you here?

05:29.495 --> 05:30.538
And who is she?

05:31.914 --> 05:32.749
Right.

05:34.042 --> 05:36.002
She is Mu-deok, my maid.

05:38.629 --> 05:39.839
Mu-deok?

05:42.508 --> 05:46.763
Yul, you startled her.
Can you put your blade down?

05:47.638 --> 05:48.765
Right.

05:51.601 --> 05:53.519
Mu-deok, are you all right?

05:56.397 --> 05:57.440
Mu-deok.

05:59.901 --> 06:01.819
I am fine, Young Master.

06:02.403 --> 06:03.321
Good.

06:04.280 --> 06:05.364
Uk?

06:06.157 --> 06:07.075
Hey.

06:08.409 --> 06:10.995
Hold on. Why are you here?

06:11.079 --> 06:14.624
I came to visit the leader.
We took refuge here after hearing a fight.

06:15.333 --> 06:18.127
There were intruders.
You cannot even fight.

06:18.211 --> 06:21.089
Jeez. Thank goodness
they did not spot you.

06:21.172 --> 06:22.632
No.

06:22.715 --> 06:25.051
It was wise of you to hide here.

06:25.134 --> 06:28.346
My maid ran away,
so I just followed her, you…

06:28.429 --> 06:29.680
Gosh, that hurts…

06:30.431 --> 06:32.141
Who is she?

06:37.188 --> 06:38.523
What is with that blade?

06:45.238 --> 06:46.072
You…

06:49.283 --> 06:51.202
Were you trying to protect him with that?

06:52.161 --> 06:53.955
I am proud of you.

06:54.038 --> 06:57.333
That is right. Your young master
is extremely weak,

06:57.416 --> 06:59.335
so you need to protect him.

07:01.504 --> 07:02.672
Of course.

07:02.755 --> 07:04.966
I ought to protect my young master.

07:06.008 --> 07:08.302
No, that is not true.

07:09.554 --> 07:12.348
I should protect you instead.

07:13.808 --> 07:15.143
What is with the strong grip?

07:15.893 --> 07:16.978
Let go.

07:25.027 --> 07:28.573
Mu-deok! You should not glare like that!

07:29.282 --> 07:30.491
You should look down.

07:32.994 --> 07:35.371
Yes, Young Master.

07:36.664 --> 07:38.916
So you were the one who ran away from me.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.334
Mu-deok, was it?

07:41.294 --> 07:42.795
I am sorry to have startled you.

07:55.099 --> 07:56.684
Are you injured?

08:09.530 --> 08:10.573
Mu-deok.

08:11.449 --> 08:13.951
I am fine, Young Master.

08:16.954 --> 08:19.040
- Has the dust settled?
- No.

08:19.123 --> 08:20.291
It is still chaotic.

08:20.875 --> 08:22.835
Soul Shifter Naksu's body
has gone missing.

08:24.170 --> 08:26.797
I knew it. They were the Danju's men.

08:26.881 --> 08:29.509
Now, I just need
to get out of here safely.

08:30.218 --> 08:31.969
What a pity.

08:32.720 --> 08:33.971
The soul shifter.

08:34.055 --> 08:36.098
Naksu, the Shadow Assassin.

08:37.350 --> 08:40.895
I was always curious about how she looked.

08:43.022 --> 08:45.316
He knows who I am.

08:45.399 --> 08:47.652
I must kill him before I leave.

08:52.281 --> 08:55.368
They must have broken
the pine forest barrier and gone out.

09:08.673 --> 09:10.466
So they broke the barrier.

09:10.550 --> 09:12.885
- We will go after them.
- It is too late.

09:14.428 --> 09:16.931
Only those of Songrim
can break the barrier.

09:18.057 --> 09:19.809
There is a spy among us.

09:21.519 --> 09:23.729
We must ask the Jin family for help.

09:30.403 --> 09:33.489
Naksu's body was in this secret room.

09:34.574 --> 09:37.994
Uk, did you notice anything suspicious
while hiding in Jeongjingak?

09:38.077 --> 09:39.620
Suspicious?

09:39.704 --> 09:42.456
No. I was only watching Mu-deok.

09:46.919 --> 09:50.464
Do you think Naksu shifted her soul
into another woman's body

09:50.548 --> 09:51.966
and came to retrieve her body?

09:55.845 --> 09:58.264
Can women only shift souls
to the same gender?

09:58.347 --> 09:59.473
Not really.

09:59.557 --> 10:03.144
But for everything to go smoothly,
I heard they should pick someone similar.

10:03.227 --> 10:06.022
Gender, age, and build.
They all need to be similar.

10:07.940 --> 10:09.525
I am only asking
because I have not seen her.

10:09.609 --> 10:13.654
Was Naksu thin with short limbs?

10:13.738 --> 10:16.407
Did she have a round face
like Mu-deok right here?

10:16.490 --> 10:18.326
What the hell is his problem?

10:20.911 --> 10:24.457
If that was the case,
she would not have been nicknamed "Naksu".

10:24.540 --> 10:25.416
Look at her.

10:26.208 --> 10:28.961
What kind of an assassin
looks this adorable?

10:29.837 --> 10:30.838
You are right.

10:30.921 --> 10:33.174
I bet she was a monster.

10:33.257 --> 10:35.426
No, she was human.

10:37.303 --> 10:40.348
Let us not belittle the dead,
even if she was an assassin.

10:46.270 --> 10:48.314
Master Heo Yeom wants to see you.

10:48.397 --> 10:50.358
Go without me. He dislikes me anyway.

10:50.441 --> 10:52.151
Right. Being here would be safer.

10:52.234 --> 10:53.402
Let us go.

11:04.872 --> 11:06.624
The body was frozen here.

11:06.707 --> 11:10.503
Seeing how there is no rotting smell,
your body must still be fine.

11:12.463 --> 11:13.506
Naksu.

11:15.132 --> 11:16.300
That is right.

11:17.134 --> 11:19.470
I am the Shadow Assassin.

11:22.181 --> 11:23.474
Naksu.

11:28.187 --> 11:30.398
I thought long and hard
about why you helped me.

11:32.650 --> 11:34.485
Did the Danju send you too?

11:34.568 --> 11:36.987
No. No one sent me here.

11:37.071 --> 11:38.989
Then why did you help me?

11:39.073 --> 11:42.451
I already told you,
but I guess you did not get the message.

11:45.204 --> 11:46.539
You have beautiful eyes.

11:47.289 --> 11:48.541
Do not tell me

11:49.834 --> 11:51.085
you really fell for me.

11:53.379 --> 11:54.422
Do not laugh.

11:55.005 --> 11:57.174
That is the only thing that makes sense.

11:57.258 --> 11:59.176
I do admit repeatedly calling you pretty.

12:00.177 --> 12:02.012
But it was because I desired something.

12:02.638 --> 12:03.806
Which was?

12:04.473 --> 12:08.769
I have been searching for someone who
can break this spell to call my master.

12:09.562 --> 12:11.021
And then, I found you.

12:13.023 --> 12:14.108
Naksu.

12:14.900 --> 12:16.861
I want you to be my master.

12:32.793 --> 12:33.919
I heard.

12:34.003 --> 12:36.046
You borrowed
the Jin family's ghost Sapsali?

12:36.130 --> 12:37.089
Yes, my lord.

12:37.673 --> 12:41.135
Are you certain that thing is in Songrim?

12:41.218 --> 12:42.303
I am.

12:43.345 --> 12:47.057
A soul shifter is lurking within Songrim.

12:51.520 --> 12:53.522
The son of Jang Gang of Songrim

12:53.606 --> 12:56.066
is asking me, an assassin,
to be his master?

12:57.735 --> 12:59.487
What original nonsense.

13:01.155 --> 13:04.617
You will open your pupil's gate of energy
and help him master spells.

13:05.201 --> 13:08.037
As your pupil,
I will keep you safe and hidden.

13:08.120 --> 13:11.457
We could form a beautiful relationship
where we benefit from each other.

13:11.540 --> 13:13.417
- Not interested.
- If you do not want to be my master,

13:13.501 --> 13:15.211
you could be my wife instead.

13:15.294 --> 13:16.587
- Would you like that?
- Shut it.

13:17.254 --> 13:20.216
I heard you visited many masters
and got kicked out every time.

13:20.299 --> 13:22.259
Was it because you were this stubborn?

13:26.222 --> 13:29.558
I could not threaten my former masters
since they had no weakness.

13:30.184 --> 13:33.896
But you have a pretty big one.

13:37.107 --> 13:39.443
You cannot get out of here alive
without my help.

13:40.194 --> 13:42.112
You will die if they find out who you are.

13:43.030 --> 13:44.156
Is that so?

13:44.990 --> 13:46.450
In that case,

13:49.870 --> 13:51.205
I will just kill you.

13:53.666 --> 13:56.585
How merciless. After all, I helped you.

13:56.669 --> 13:59.630
Sorry that I am so merciless
for such a cute face.

14:08.847 --> 14:11.141
I brought you to our house
with the Jade Plaque

14:11.809 --> 14:13.852
and to Songrim with the Spirit Plaque.

14:14.645 --> 14:16.730
And now, look where we are.

14:24.530 --> 14:26.115
This is Songrim's secret room.

14:27.074 --> 14:30.536
Once that door closes, we can only get out
if someone opens from the outside.

14:31.787 --> 14:33.372
We are locked in here together.

14:35.624 --> 14:36.792
Do not move!

14:37.293 --> 14:39.879
Step on the wrong spot,
and the ground will cave in.

14:43.173 --> 14:47.303
Kill me, and you will be killed
by the Songrim mages who will enter.

14:47.386 --> 14:50.764
But if you agree to be my master,
we will get out of this unscathed.

14:54.184 --> 14:57.271
I do not have the strength
to break his gate of energy right now.

14:57.771 --> 14:59.648
He will catch wind of it if I stay here.

15:00.232 --> 15:01.275
I need my sword.

15:02.651 --> 15:04.612
I have become weak due to shifting souls.

15:04.695 --> 15:07.531
I need my sword's energy
to open your gate of energy.

15:08.073 --> 15:09.241
Without that,

15:09.867 --> 15:12.536
there is nothing I can do in here.

15:13.662 --> 15:15.122
To retrieve my sword,

15:16.498 --> 15:17.708
I need to go out there.

15:17.791 --> 15:18.918
So stop that.

15:21.170 --> 15:22.463
Did you not hear me?

15:22.546 --> 15:25.633
I cannot do that. I need to wait
until it fully closes first.

15:27.301 --> 15:29.470
You! You lied, did you not?

15:32.598 --> 15:33.807
Do not move!

15:33.891 --> 15:36.060
- If you do, the ground will cave in!
- Wait!

15:39.146 --> 15:40.773
Grab tightly! You are slipping!

15:41.649 --> 15:44.276
- Where is your face touching?
- Shut it!

15:44.360 --> 15:46.070
- Hey!
- Hey!

15:46.153 --> 15:47.112
You little…

15:47.863 --> 15:50.532
- That hurts!
- It was not intentional.

15:50.616 --> 15:52.743
- It hurts!
- Just wait.

15:53.327 --> 15:54.203
Let me go.

16:00.000 --> 16:02.252
By the way, how will we find your sword?

16:03.128 --> 16:05.130
I know who took it. I can find it.

16:06.423 --> 16:08.342
It is too dangerous to get out of Songrim.

16:08.425 --> 16:10.052
We need to stay inside.

16:11.345 --> 16:13.263
Does it have to be that specific sword?

16:13.347 --> 16:15.140
Get another sword with that energy
and do it here.

16:15.224 --> 16:17.351
I cannot. It has to be mine.

16:18.602 --> 16:20.104
Let us go out and find it.

16:21.063 --> 16:24.191
I will lure him out and then kill him.

16:25.526 --> 16:27.277
You said you became weak.

16:30.280 --> 16:32.533
I thought you were pretending
to be clumsy.

16:33.909 --> 16:35.077
How weak have you become?

16:38.163 --> 16:39.581
The mages are coming.

16:39.665 --> 16:40.708
Stay alert.

16:43.585 --> 16:46.547
Why would I? They are on my side.

16:48.048 --> 16:50.551
Taking sides?
Are you seriously that childish?

16:50.634 --> 16:52.469
Why are you talking casually
in this situation?

16:52.553 --> 16:53.762
Fine, Young Master.

16:53.846 --> 16:55.097
I will look down.

16:55.806 --> 16:56.974
Look at you.

17:04.231 --> 17:05.274
Who is she?

17:06.066 --> 17:09.111
I am Mu-deok, his maid.

17:11.613 --> 17:13.615
You heard her, right? She is my maid.

17:14.199 --> 17:15.909
You all seem busy. Go on, then.

17:15.993 --> 17:18.412
- Let us go, Mu-deok.
- You may not leave.

17:21.081 --> 17:24.084
The leader ordered everyone
to gather at the Training Center.

17:26.420 --> 17:27.838
I am not a member of Songrim.

17:27.921 --> 17:30.174
He wants every living thing
within these walls

17:30.799 --> 17:33.052
to gather there.

17:41.643 --> 17:43.145
- Uk.
- Hey.

17:45.064 --> 17:47.483
What is going on?
Why are we gathered here?

17:48.025 --> 17:50.652
They are going to catch
Naksu's men who are in here.

17:52.821 --> 17:54.073
Naksu?

18:04.833 --> 18:06.043
One of you

18:06.126 --> 18:09.004
has helped Naksu's men
who sneaked in here today.

18:09.838 --> 18:10.839
My lord.

18:10.923 --> 18:14.093
Everyone here knows each other.

18:14.176 --> 18:17.805
On the outside,
you all look like those of Songrim.

18:20.057 --> 18:21.975
That is why I asked someone for help.

18:23.185 --> 18:26.438
Lady Jin Cho-yeon of the Jin family
has brought Gwigu.

19:02.099 --> 19:03.142
Hello, my lady.

19:17.114 --> 19:19.241
Why is Jang Uk here?

19:20.325 --> 19:21.368
I am not sure.

19:32.004 --> 19:34.965
That must be Gwigu,
the Jin family's heirloom.

19:35.048 --> 19:36.091
Gwigu?

19:36.675 --> 19:37.968
- As in a dog?
- Yes.

19:38.051 --> 19:40.762
It is a ghost Sapsali
that detects sorcery.

19:45.350 --> 19:46.476
There is

19:47.561 --> 19:48.812
a soul shifter among us.

19:50.272 --> 19:54.359
And Gwigu will find that individual.

19:55.027 --> 19:57.654
They look like one of us on the outside.

19:57.738 --> 20:01.116
But Gwigu will find the one
who has a different soul within them.

20:07.289 --> 20:09.041
Close all the doors.

20:09.124 --> 20:10.000
- Yes, my lord!
- Yes, my lord!

20:14.796 --> 20:19.134
Whoever tries to leave this building

20:19.218 --> 20:22.471
will be considered a spy and killed.

20:23.931 --> 20:25.057
You may begin.

21:26.326 --> 21:29.830
The alchemy of souls, a type of sorcery,
has one weakness.

21:29.913 --> 21:31.873
There is a gap
between the body and the soul.

21:31.957 --> 21:34.376
The evil energy seeps out from it.

21:34.459 --> 21:36.837
And Gwigu can detect that.

22:05.574 --> 22:08.577
Uk, feign ignorance even if I get caught.

22:10.996 --> 22:13.123
- Is this loyalty?
- It is my duty.

22:19.296 --> 22:21.757
I do not want to become a laughingstock

22:22.424 --> 22:24.384
once they find out I asked you for help.

22:24.468 --> 22:25.969
Stay right by my side.

22:27.137 --> 22:30.807
No one here will let that thing attack me.

23:01.922 --> 23:03.298
He is a soul shifter! Get him!

24:31.928 --> 24:35.015
I heard soul shifters get petrified
when they run wild and lose their energy.

24:35.098 --> 24:36.308
It was true.

25:04.878 --> 25:07.339
We thank you for your great help.

25:08.715 --> 25:10.967
I am sure one day
we will ask you for help too.

25:12.135 --> 25:16.723
I see that Daeho's four families
have all gathered here.

25:16.806 --> 25:18.892
I heard you are called the Four Seasons.

25:19.476 --> 25:22.646
Seeing you all together makes me happy.

25:23.396 --> 25:25.106
We used to gather often,

25:25.190 --> 25:28.401
but it is our first time after Uk
and Cho-yeon called off their wedding.

25:29.903 --> 25:31.279
You little…

25:31.863 --> 25:34.324
I told them to prepare some tea
in the reception room.

25:34.407 --> 25:35.617
Please come.

25:42.290 --> 25:44.084
You were here as well.

25:44.793 --> 25:46.878
I heard you were kicked out of Gisan.

25:46.962 --> 25:48.505
Right.

25:49.422 --> 25:52.217
You should stop
keeping track of what I am doing.

25:54.970 --> 25:57.889
Everyone was talking about
how you got kicked out yet again.

25:57.973 --> 25:59.516
I just happened to hear it.

25:59.599 --> 26:00.934
I see.

26:01.977 --> 26:04.854
Our precious guest here
seems uncomfortable around me,

26:04.938 --> 26:06.314
so let me excuse myself.

26:09.776 --> 26:11.027
What a scumbag.

26:12.904 --> 26:13.947
Let us go.

26:16.157 --> 26:17.242
Let us go.

26:29.254 --> 26:31.673
Hey, excuse me.

26:32.757 --> 26:34.718
Did you see my maid?

26:35.302 --> 26:37.929
She is short, thin, and has a round face.

26:38.013 --> 26:39.306
Darn it.

26:40.181 --> 26:41.808
Where did she go?

26:43.560 --> 26:46.646
The spy the Danju had sent here
was a soul shifter.

26:48.315 --> 26:49.983
I must find the Danju.

27:01.119 --> 27:03.538
You were not loyal,
but you said you knew your duties.

27:04.122 --> 27:06.041
Can you say the same thing about this?

27:07.125 --> 27:09.544
That is exactly
why I am leaving you behind.

27:09.627 --> 27:12.047
My original plan
was to take you with me and kill you.

27:12.130 --> 27:13.089
I see.

27:13.882 --> 27:15.258
How evil.

27:15.342 --> 27:19.012
I am not the round-faced Mu-deok,
your loyal maid.

27:19.929 --> 27:22.891
You are Naksu. The merciless assassin.

27:25.560 --> 27:28.313
You had the chance to kill me
when I was bathing.

27:28.396 --> 27:30.607
I even risked my life
bringing you here with me.

27:31.858 --> 27:33.985
It is up to you
whether to still kill me now

27:34.069 --> 27:37.030
or become my master
after opening my gate of energy.

27:42.452 --> 27:46.623
By the way, you have the habit
of glaring at others.

27:46.706 --> 27:48.958
Keep doing that, and you will get caught.

27:50.085 --> 27:52.253
Can you see the mark
from where you are at?

27:53.671 --> 27:54.714
No.

27:57.634 --> 27:58.593
What about now?

28:01.429 --> 28:02.847
I can see it since I know already.

28:04.849 --> 28:05.975
And now?

28:13.400 --> 28:15.110
I can definitely see it.

28:15.193 --> 28:17.862
But I doubt you will be
this up-close with someone often.

28:18.530 --> 28:20.407
Just be careful when you kiss someone.

28:22.742 --> 28:24.619
Come on. I am just helping you out.

28:24.702 --> 28:27.163
Anyone who came that close to me
died in my hands.

28:29.666 --> 28:31.042
You could die tonight.

28:32.419 --> 28:33.628
It is the ghost Sapsali.

28:41.136 --> 28:42.595
If that thing attacks you,

28:42.679 --> 28:44.472
will you turn to stone like that guy?

28:46.391 --> 28:47.517
Run.

28:49.644 --> 28:50.729
I will try to save you.

30:13.561 --> 30:15.188
Gwigu's pottery.

30:15.271 --> 30:17.398
It was our family heirloom.

30:18.691 --> 30:21.611
I just wanted to take a look at it.

30:21.694 --> 30:24.781
But what kind of an heirloom
is this fragile?

30:24.864 --> 30:26.199
Jang Uk!

30:29.911 --> 30:31.663
We need to talk. Come here.

30:32.330 --> 30:33.414
Uk.

30:35.458 --> 30:36.584
Uk.

30:38.419 --> 30:41.631
Hey, Uk. Jang Uk!

30:46.344 --> 30:47.428
Uk!

30:48.763 --> 30:49.848
Uk!

30:50.473 --> 30:51.808
Jang Uk!

30:52.392 --> 30:53.768
Darn it!

30:55.103 --> 30:56.062
Uk!

30:57.272 --> 30:58.314
Gather all the pieces

30:58.398 --> 31:00.608
since I will have to
put them back together.

31:00.692 --> 31:01.985
- Yes, my lady.
- Yes, my lady.

31:17.208 --> 31:18.501
Jeez.

31:19.127 --> 31:20.962
That is the work of your young master.

31:22.672 --> 31:25.341
So that is how he saved me.

31:25.425 --> 31:26.509
Gosh, that kid.

31:26.593 --> 31:29.137
Last year, he broke off the engagement
with the Jin family.

31:29.220 --> 31:31.639
This time, he broke their heirloom.

31:31.723 --> 31:33.975
- Engagement?
- Yes.

31:35.184 --> 31:37.061
He called off the wedding with her.

31:37.729 --> 31:41.274
He got kicked out 12 times,
broke off a wedding, and now, an heirloom.

31:41.357 --> 31:42.817
What a disaster.

31:45.570 --> 31:47.280
What will you do about him?

31:48.197 --> 31:49.365
Where is he?

31:50.366 --> 31:51.284
He got dragged away.

31:51.951 --> 31:55.288
I am afraid he will face
severe punishment this time.

32:02.712 --> 32:05.214
I sent you to Gisan.

32:06.299 --> 32:08.509
Then you were kicked out
in less than six months.

32:09.344 --> 32:11.095
Why did you come here tonight?

32:11.179 --> 32:14.223
I heard you were troubled by the news,
so I came to apologize.

32:14.807 --> 32:16.184
Is this how you apologize?

32:18.811 --> 32:21.689
Why did you break the pottery?

32:21.773 --> 32:24.484
I was fascinated by it
and wanted to take a look,

32:24.567 --> 32:26.736
but it slipped out of my hands.

32:26.819 --> 32:29.364
Had I learned spells,
that would not have happened.

32:29.447 --> 32:30.907
I guess I lack the teachings.

32:30.990 --> 32:32.575
Jang Uk!

32:34.243 --> 32:36.079
He also tampered

32:36.162 --> 32:38.331
with the door of the secret room
and damaged it.

32:38.831 --> 32:41.960
He definitely did that on purpose.
He is just jealous.

32:42.752 --> 32:45.838
I will not let it slide this time around.

32:46.798 --> 32:49.968
Until I say so, I forbid Jang Uk

32:50.051 --> 32:53.721
from moving or talking.

32:55.056 --> 32:56.349
Repent.

33:15.576 --> 33:16.577
Do not worry.

33:18.037 --> 33:19.914
He will not punish him for too long.

33:21.457 --> 33:23.960
He almost died of a cold
after he was punished

33:24.043 --> 33:25.169
all night long one day.

33:26.087 --> 33:29.382
Uk's gate of energy is opened
just enough to keep him alive.

33:29.465 --> 33:32.051
So extreme cold or heat
can be life-threatening.

33:32.844 --> 33:34.053
He cannot recover when he falls ill.

33:34.637 --> 33:38.516
Then open his gate of energy for him.
He desperately wants it.

33:39.142 --> 33:40.852
You are his friends.

33:41.894 --> 33:43.771
We are still too weak to do that.

33:45.106 --> 33:46.566
But no one in Songrim…

33:46.649 --> 33:50.278
No. No one in Daeho is allowed to do that.

33:55.491 --> 33:58.619
Then he is already being punished
for his entire lifetime.

34:33.321 --> 34:35.364
You are allowed to have a hot cup of tea.

34:38.910 --> 34:40.036
Young Master.

34:40.661 --> 34:43.581
I will go first and leave you behind.

34:45.166 --> 34:46.542
You are leaving without me?

34:54.008 --> 34:56.385
You are loyal and know your duties.

34:57.261 --> 34:59.639
That is why you took me in,
brought me here,

35:00.723 --> 35:02.892
and protected me.

35:03.976 --> 35:07.271
You must know very well
that you cannot tell that to anyone.

35:20.159 --> 35:22.662
I will be safe thanks to you.

35:33.673 --> 35:36.676
The people I have met so far
only wanted me dead.

35:37.969 --> 35:39.846
You are the first person

35:41.222 --> 35:42.849
who tried to save me.

35:49.188 --> 35:51.816
Even if we meet again
and come this close to each other,

35:52.441 --> 35:53.985
I will spare you.

36:51.083 --> 36:53.961
I will send a gift of apology to Gisan

36:54.045 --> 36:58.216
and pay the Jin family a hefty sum
for what he did.

36:58.799 --> 37:02.220
Uk made too many mistakes this time.

37:03.763 --> 37:05.473
I had no choice but to punish him.

37:05.556 --> 37:07.391
I am glad you punished him.

37:08.476 --> 37:11.771
Since you have done enough,
I will take him home now.

37:12.521 --> 37:13.689
Sure.

37:15.399 --> 37:16.525
Thank you.

37:22.448 --> 37:25.534
- Are you all right?
- No, I am not.

37:27.536 --> 37:29.747
Did Mu-deok stop by our place?

37:30.331 --> 37:32.333
Why would she?

37:33.209 --> 37:36.879
Speaking of which, where did she go
while you were being punished?

37:37.505 --> 37:38.589
Forget it.

37:41.884 --> 37:44.762
By the way, why did you tamper
with the secret room?

37:45.846 --> 37:47.431
The stone door will not close.

37:48.099 --> 37:49.433
I do not know.

37:52.311 --> 37:54.814
- Why did you break the pottery?
- I do not…

37:56.816 --> 37:58.401
I said I do not know.

37:59.026 --> 38:00.361
Stop asking me.

38:10.454 --> 38:12.373
Here are the firecrackers you wanted.

38:12.456 --> 38:14.500
They will be able to see them
from miles away.

38:17.545 --> 38:18.671
All right.

38:19.672 --> 38:22.633
Why does Young Master Jang want them?

38:22.717 --> 38:25.094
Rumor has it that
he was punished severely.

38:25.177 --> 38:26.679
So what is he scheming this time?

38:28.681 --> 38:29.682
It is a secret.

38:30.558 --> 38:32.351
Do not tell anyone about this, okay?

38:34.145 --> 38:35.396
Ju-wol.

38:37.273 --> 38:39.317
He should lie low for now.

38:46.073 --> 38:47.450
This is Songrim's Spirit Plaque.

38:48.034 --> 38:49.910
Are you free to enter there?

38:49.994 --> 38:52.163
Your young master must really trust you.

38:52.913 --> 38:54.999
This is such a precious item.

38:56.083 --> 38:57.626
He wants me to sell it.

38:58.544 --> 39:01.213
You cannot sell
something like this that easily.

39:01.297 --> 39:02.298
Is that so?

39:02.840 --> 39:05.134
He said I would be able
to sell it somewhere.

39:05.718 --> 39:06.761
But then again,

39:06.844 --> 39:10.222
there is a merchant
who purchases black market goods.

39:11.807 --> 39:14.226
But it will not be easy to hook you up.

39:20.733 --> 39:22.860
You will be getting a hefty sum.

39:22.943 --> 39:24.862
Can I have another chicken?

39:24.945 --> 39:27.531
Sure. I will put it on
your young master's tab.

39:27.615 --> 39:29.533
Eat up. Eat lots.

39:36.791 --> 39:41.087
Naksu's body may be here,
but her soul lives on in another body.

39:41.962 --> 39:45.883
You will also be given new bodies
through the alchemy of souls.

39:45.966 --> 39:50.346
So do not be afraid
to sacrifice yourselves for me.

39:50.429 --> 39:51.597
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

40:11.742 --> 40:12.660
Fire!

40:31.345 --> 40:32.847
I need my sword.

40:32.930 --> 40:34.974
I have become weak due to shifting souls.

40:35.683 --> 40:38.602
I need my sword's energy
to open your gate of energy.

40:38.686 --> 40:41.313
Even if we meet again
and come this close to each other,

40:41.897 --> 40:43.399
I will spare you.

40:48.195 --> 40:50.656
- I have no appetite.
- Young Master Jang.

40:52.867 --> 40:54.660
Young Master Jang, they caught them.

40:55.244 --> 40:57.913
- Mu-deok?
- Why would anyone catch her?

40:58.914 --> 41:01.041
Never mind.

41:01.125 --> 41:02.835
Jin Mu, the Assistant Gwanju
of Cheonbugwan,

41:02.918 --> 41:05.337
caught Naksu's men who raided Songrim.

41:05.963 --> 41:06.964
Really?

41:09.550 --> 41:13.429
Jin Mu brought the bodies
of Naksu's men into the palace.

41:13.512 --> 41:15.639
We were the ones who caught Naksu.

41:15.723 --> 41:18.517
So I am worried
we will become a laughingstock.

41:18.601 --> 41:21.604
Is it true that he spared

41:22.146 --> 41:23.814
none of the men?

41:23.898 --> 41:25.399
He killed them all.

41:26.901 --> 41:29.737
We have no way to track
the source of the alchemy of souls.

41:31.864 --> 41:34.200
Jin Ho-gyeong of Jinyowon is here too.

41:39.330 --> 41:41.457
I heard Jin Mu,
the Assistant Gwanju of Cheonbugwan,

41:41.540 --> 41:44.335
caught the assassins
that Songrim could not.

41:45.169 --> 41:48.172
How did they break
Songrim's barrier twice?

41:53.010 --> 41:55.262
There was a soul shifter spy
inside Songrim.

41:55.346 --> 41:58.641
Thankfully, the Jin family's Gwigu
caught him.

41:59.600 --> 42:00.893
Gwigu?

42:00.976 --> 42:02.853
I would like to see it too.

42:02.937 --> 42:05.231
I am afraid I cannot show you right now.

42:05.314 --> 42:08.150
They made the mistake
of accidentally breaking it.

42:09.235 --> 42:11.487
How could you make such a foolish mistake?

42:12.947 --> 42:14.198
My apologies, Your Majesty.

42:15.241 --> 42:19.411
Since Jin Mu made this contribution,
I summoned you all to tell you

42:19.495 --> 42:21.747
that I am considering
promoting him to Gwanju.

42:22.957 --> 42:24.208
That is not right.

42:24.291 --> 42:27.002
Jang Gang is still the current Gwanju.

42:27.086 --> 42:30.089
For he was given the robe
and the sword by the late king,

42:30.172 --> 42:32.049
Jang Gang is the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan.

42:32.633 --> 42:35.302
Furthermore, he has a son, Jang Uk.

42:35.386 --> 42:36.220
Jang Gang…

42:37.054 --> 42:38.430
has been away for decades

42:38.514 --> 42:40.140
using his training as an excuse.

42:40.224 --> 42:43.269
His son, Jang Uk,
physically cannot learn spells.

42:43.352 --> 42:45.354
Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu has been the one

42:46.522 --> 42:47.606
to fill in for him.

42:49.441 --> 42:51.735
Your Majesty, the dark soul-related spell

42:51.819 --> 42:55.197
is forbidden sorcery among mages.

42:55.281 --> 42:57.408
And Songrim has always been the one

42:57.950 --> 42:59.785
to keep this under control.

43:00.369 --> 43:03.872
Songrim could have gotten to the bottom
of this soul shifter incident

43:03.956 --> 43:05.416
and gotten rid of it all.

43:07.042 --> 43:10.921
But Jin Mu
killed every single one of them.

43:12.047 --> 43:14.508
He actually ruined everything.

43:14.592 --> 43:16.218
Are you unhappy

43:17.052 --> 43:19.888
that Cheonbugwan took the credit?

43:19.972 --> 43:22.099
Songrim was the one who caught Naksu!

43:22.182 --> 43:24.059
And you took credit for it!

43:26.395 --> 43:28.314
We are not here to discuss that.

43:30.816 --> 43:34.486
As for the Gwanju position,
we will hold a mage meeting

43:34.570 --> 43:37.573
and make a decision
once Jang Gang returns.

43:38.574 --> 43:41.702
Please grant him a different reward.

43:45.205 --> 43:46.457
Jin Mu.

43:48.417 --> 43:50.210
Tell me what you desire.

43:53.088 --> 43:55.007
The people are troubled by this sorcery.

43:55.090 --> 43:57.509
Allow me to burn
Naksu's body in front of Cheonbugwan.

43:57.593 --> 43:58.761
As for Naksu's sword…

43:59.845 --> 44:03.182
Allow us to keep it
since Songrim has lost it once already.

44:06.602 --> 44:08.312
You may do that.

44:17.529 --> 44:21.700
The best swords of the mages
have always been stored

44:21.784 --> 44:24.536
in the Sword Room of Jeongjingak.

44:25.663 --> 44:28.082
But things have changed
after that incident.

44:29.541 --> 44:31.710
Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan took Naksu's sword?

44:31.794 --> 44:35.381
Yes. He will burn Naksu's body there too.

44:35.464 --> 44:38.050
She will be there to witness
her body getting burned.

44:38.133 --> 44:39.176
Who?

44:39.259 --> 44:40.177
Naksu?

44:40.928 --> 44:43.138
Do you still think
Naksu has switched souls?

44:44.306 --> 44:46.809
Are you serious
about accepting Naksu as your master?

44:47.976 --> 44:49.103
Forget it.

44:50.020 --> 44:51.355
Pour me some more tea.

44:54.358 --> 44:57.277
You can do that yourself,

44:57.361 --> 44:58.904
lazybones.

45:01.740 --> 45:04.284
Where is your maid, Mu-deok?

45:05.661 --> 45:09.456
I will find her.
But first, I need that sword.

45:16.547 --> 45:19.133
Seeing how he got rid
of everything that was mine,

45:19.633 --> 45:22.219
he must think I failed
to switch souls and died.

45:23.762 --> 45:26.640
I cannot look for the Danju
since I do not know who he is.

45:35.274 --> 45:38.026
Find the merchant
who is selling a drawn Spirit Plaque,

45:38.110 --> 45:39.528
and you will find me.

45:40.112 --> 45:41.405
I will be waiting.

46:04.136 --> 46:05.596
That is Danhyanggok.

46:08.724 --> 46:12.227
CHEONBUGWAN

46:12.311 --> 46:14.021
I am here for Naksu's sword.

46:14.730 --> 46:16.023
Why would you?

46:16.106 --> 46:19.151
I heard His Majesty allowed
Cheonbugwan to keep it.

46:19.234 --> 46:22.738
Since Jang Gang is the Gwanju,
it is right for his family to keep it.

46:22.821 --> 46:24.072
Since your father is not here,

46:24.156 --> 46:26.492
it is only right that
the Assistant Gwanju keeps it.

46:29.953 --> 46:33.540
Since my father is not here,
I, his son, should keep it.

46:38.253 --> 46:40.672
I heard you are searching everywhere
for your master.

46:41.423 --> 46:43.133
I would like to take you in myself.

46:43.800 --> 46:46.512
But I cannot defy your father's commands
since he was my master once.

46:48.180 --> 46:51.266
Why did he close
his own son's gate of energy?

46:52.309 --> 46:54.186
I just cannot fathom it.

46:58.857 --> 47:01.276
The mage's energy
flows through this sword.

47:01.360 --> 47:05.447
Someone as ordinary as you
will not be able to unsheathe it.

47:29.179 --> 47:30.973
Are you afraid I will do it?

47:33.892 --> 47:36.478
If I unsheathe it,
I will be qualified as the next Gwanju.

47:36.562 --> 47:39.439
meaning you will be disqualified
from getting that position.

47:44.861 --> 47:45.904
Do not worry.

47:46.697 --> 47:48.073
I cannot unsheathe it for now.

48:00.002 --> 48:01.211
"For now"?

48:05.090 --> 48:07.759
I saw firecrackers
coming from Danhyanggok.

48:07.843 --> 48:09.678
Are you sure it was Danhyanggok?

48:09.761 --> 48:10.596
Yes, my lord.

48:10.679 --> 48:13.223
They came from the valley,
Naksu's former home.

48:33.243 --> 48:34.870
I am looking for the one
with the Spirit Plaque.

48:44.338 --> 48:46.131
Ma'am, they are here.

48:50.927 --> 48:52.679
I guess someone wants to buy it.

48:58.268 --> 49:00.103
The very last room, please.

49:06.026 --> 49:07.819
How could you lose it?

49:07.903 --> 49:10.280
I did not lose it. Someone stole it.

49:10.364 --> 49:11.865
I am certain it was Ae-hyang.

49:14.326 --> 49:16.328
Are you the one who brought this?

49:18.830 --> 49:21.083
I am here to buy the Spirit Plaque.

49:21.917 --> 49:23.460
You have come to the right person.

49:30.717 --> 49:32.511
She is no longer useful.

49:32.594 --> 49:34.429
Kill her to avoid further problems.

49:46.858 --> 49:47.776
You know me, right?

49:47.859 --> 49:50.070
I told you to let me know
if someone brought that drawing.

49:50.737 --> 49:51.571
And I did.

49:52.322 --> 49:54.533
She is meeting them upstairs.

49:55.409 --> 49:57.661
So it was Ae-hyang.

50:02.916 --> 50:04.459
We are mages from Cheonbugwan.

50:05.043 --> 50:08.255
We just caught a thief.
You can mind your own business.

50:14.469 --> 50:15.637
He killed her.

50:16.680 --> 50:18.223
He thought it was me.

50:47.419 --> 50:49.588
The Danju has cut me off.

51:16.948 --> 51:19.242
Is that truly you?

51:23.955 --> 51:26.041
- Begin.
- Yes, my lord.

51:52.359 --> 51:55.028
Cheonbugwan caught Naksu
when Songrim failed?

51:55.111 --> 51:57.489
Songrim was pretty much humiliated.

51:57.572 --> 52:00.992
The Assistant Gwanju is over there.

52:01.076 --> 52:02.035
You are right.

52:18.218 --> 52:20.220
So the Danju was Jin Mu,

52:20.303 --> 52:23.974
the Assistant Gwanju
of the royal Cheonbugwan.

52:36.278 --> 52:38.113
I am burning.

52:39.614 --> 52:43.952
Just like how my house
and parents burned on that day.

52:50.250 --> 52:52.043
I will give you power.

52:52.127 --> 52:53.837
Will you come with me?

53:32.000 --> 53:33.209
Young Master Jang.

53:34.169 --> 53:36.755
As you can see, there is nothing I can do

53:37.547 --> 53:39.716
but watch my body burn.

53:41.551 --> 53:43.511
There is nothing I can do for you either.

53:50.810 --> 53:52.145
I found your sword.

53:59.653 --> 54:01.988
You said you could retrieve
your power with this.

54:08.995 --> 54:12.040
Why are you standing still?
Pick it up and unsheathe it.

54:29.975 --> 54:32.519
An excellent blade recognizes its owner.

54:42.654 --> 54:45.365
Now, I just need to receive its energy.

55:21.943 --> 55:24.195
You are too weak to handle

55:25.280 --> 55:26.740
and unsheathe your own sword.

55:29.117 --> 55:30.952
You are just as powerless as me.

55:31.953 --> 55:33.246
We are useless.

55:38.543 --> 55:41.087
That is enough. Forget it.

55:41.796 --> 55:42.922
Just go.

55:48.636 --> 55:52.474
I doubt you will be a threat to Songrim,
and Naksu is already gone.

55:53.808 --> 55:55.935
Just live as Mu-deok.

56:00.815 --> 56:02.484
I would rather die…

56:06.654 --> 56:08.073
than live like this.

56:10.617 --> 56:12.285
Then be my guest.

57:04.462 --> 57:06.422
This is the grave of the Soul Shifters.

57:07.507 --> 57:10.009
The one who taught me this spell

57:10.093 --> 57:12.637
also disposed of their bodies here.

57:23.565 --> 57:24.691
So this will be

57:26.109 --> 57:27.944
my grave as well.

57:55.680 --> 57:59.392
Young Master Jang,
how long should we keep this place closed?

58:00.768 --> 58:02.103
I am done now.

58:02.770 --> 58:04.481
What is wrong with Mu-deok?

58:04.564 --> 58:06.232
She seemed out of it.

58:10.445 --> 58:11.696
I am just worried.

58:12.614 --> 58:14.908
She was heading
toward Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

58:17.660 --> 58:18.828
Lake Gyeongcheondaeho?

58:22.123 --> 58:23.791
I would rather die…

58:25.585 --> 58:26.794
than live like this.

58:26.878 --> 58:28.338
Then be my guest.

59:41.995 --> 59:43.121
Mu-deok!

59:44.080 --> 59:45.164
Mu-deok!

59:49.836 --> 59:50.920
Darn it…

01:00:49.187 --> 01:00:52.649
SEJUKWON, SONGRIM

01:01:03.117 --> 01:01:04.577
You are in Sejukwon.

01:01:05.536 --> 01:01:07.330
Master Heo Yeom's infirmary in Songrim.

01:01:08.456 --> 01:01:11.417
Thanks to you, I could come here
even though I was once forbidden.

01:01:14.128 --> 01:01:17.507
Your eyes are probably sore.
I put in some eye drops.

01:01:18.383 --> 01:01:21.344
He said the blue marks in your eyes
were like bruises.

01:01:21.427 --> 01:01:23.971
These eye drops will lighten their color.

01:01:24.597 --> 01:01:25.682
Put them in regularly.

01:01:33.564 --> 01:01:35.191
I unsheathed this before.

01:01:36.943 --> 01:01:38.069
I definitely did.

01:01:38.152 --> 01:01:39.654
I know. I saw it.

01:01:40.405 --> 01:01:42.198
But you are still too weak.

01:01:42.281 --> 01:01:44.534
You could only do it
thanks to that lake's energy.

01:01:45.910 --> 01:01:47.954
I had regained my power inside that lake.

01:01:49.580 --> 01:01:50.873
I should go back there.

01:01:50.957 --> 01:01:54.419
Then what?
Will you live underwater like a fish?

01:01:59.882 --> 01:02:03.010
I felt a surge of energy underwater.

01:02:03.094 --> 01:02:04.721
That is how I regained my power.

01:02:05.304 --> 01:02:06.472
That is it.

01:02:07.557 --> 01:02:10.017
Someone who has energy
as powerful as that lake

01:02:10.685 --> 01:02:13.438
should push out the energy within me.

01:02:13.521 --> 01:02:16.357
And who exactly?
Will you be searching for a master too?

01:02:17.024 --> 01:02:20.194
Do you think there is anyone
that powerful, to begin with?

01:02:20.278 --> 01:02:23.239
Even if there was,
would they want to help you?

01:02:24.407 --> 01:02:26.075
You are Naksu, an assassin
who shifted her soul.

01:02:29.579 --> 01:02:30.496
What?

01:02:30.580 --> 01:02:33.166
Uk came to Sejukwon?

01:02:33.750 --> 01:02:35.918
He came to treat his maid who was injured.

01:02:36.002 --> 01:02:37.670
He barged in.

01:02:37.754 --> 01:02:38.880
His maid?

01:02:40.298 --> 01:02:41.716
Mu-deok, was it?

01:02:41.799 --> 01:02:43.259
How bad were her injuries

01:02:43.801 --> 01:02:46.721
that he would come
all the way here himself?

01:03:02.862 --> 01:03:04.989
I have only heard of Sejukwon.

01:03:05.823 --> 01:03:07.450
It sure is an incredible infirmary.

01:03:08.618 --> 01:03:10.453
There are all sorts of medicinal herbs.

01:03:11.078 --> 01:03:12.497
And poisonous ones too.

01:03:18.252 --> 01:03:22.006
I am sure these eye drops
will make your eye color faint.

01:03:22.089 --> 01:03:23.633
Lie low and live as Mu-deok.

01:03:24.509 --> 01:03:26.010
This is all I can do for you.

01:03:26.093 --> 01:03:27.386
You are wrong.

01:03:28.554 --> 01:03:31.098
I want you to be my Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:03:34.519 --> 01:03:37.188
You said you risked your life
many times for me.

01:03:38.439 --> 01:03:40.149
Do it one more time.

01:03:46.614 --> 01:03:47.907
It will be pretty painful.

01:03:55.289 --> 01:03:56.666
What did you put in here?

01:03:59.001 --> 01:04:01.003
One of the poisonous herbs.

01:04:07.802 --> 01:04:09.595
I am betting everything on you.

01:04:11.681 --> 01:04:14.642
So I hope you will survive.

01:04:31.117 --> 01:04:32.410
If you do,

01:04:35.746 --> 01:04:37.707
I will be your master.

01:04:47.550 --> 01:04:49.176
Uk!

01:04:50.136 --> 01:04:52.179
What is wrong? Uk!

01:04:52.263 --> 01:04:53.347
Uk!

01:04:53.431 --> 01:04:54.724
What is wrong with him?

01:04:55.349 --> 01:04:56.475
He ingested poison.

01:04:58.185 --> 01:04:59.687
- Poison?
- What poison?

01:04:59.770 --> 01:05:03.316
His heart will stop in six hours.

01:05:03.399 --> 01:05:04.567
What poison was it?

01:05:04.650 --> 01:05:07.069
It will be too late
by the time you find out

01:05:07.153 --> 01:05:08.905
and concoct an antidote.

01:05:08.988 --> 01:05:11.532
There is only one way to save him.

01:05:11.616 --> 01:05:12.950
Open his gate of energy

01:05:13.034 --> 01:05:16.621
and remove the poison
with both of your energy.

01:05:16.704 --> 01:05:17.914
- What?
- What?

01:05:19.415 --> 01:05:21.083
Open his gate of energy.

01:05:21.709 --> 01:05:23.294
Or else, he will die.

01:05:26.964 --> 01:05:28.758
Yul…

01:05:29.508 --> 01:05:31.260
Uk ingested poison.

01:05:32.094 --> 01:05:33.346
They say he's going to die.

01:05:33.429 --> 01:05:36.265
- What?
- Mu-deok was the one who gave it to him.

01:05:36.349 --> 01:05:38.726
But she will not say
what kind of poison it was,

01:05:38.809 --> 01:05:41.604
so my uncle is torturing her right now.

01:05:47.276 --> 01:05:48.861
What was the poison?

01:05:53.199 --> 01:05:54.951
Keep going.

01:05:55.034 --> 01:05:57.411
- She could die, my lord.
- Uk is dying.

01:05:58.162 --> 01:06:01.832
We must find out what it is
in the next two hours.

01:06:08.255 --> 01:06:09.340
Young Master Jang.

01:06:10.174 --> 01:06:11.300
Young Master Jang…

01:06:13.386 --> 01:06:14.595
Open his gate of energy.

01:06:15.805 --> 01:06:17.682
That is the only way.

01:06:20.142 --> 01:06:21.560
We are running out of time!

01:06:22.186 --> 01:06:23.312
Please…

01:06:24.313 --> 01:06:26.399
Please save Young Master Jang!

01:06:41.122 --> 01:06:42.581
- My lord.
- How is Uk?

01:06:42.665 --> 01:06:44.291
Did something happen to him?

01:06:44.375 --> 01:06:46.293
Master Heo Yeom removed the poison.

01:06:46.919 --> 01:06:48.421
Young Master Jang is safe.

01:06:49.005 --> 01:06:51.590
- Did he concoct the antidote?
- No, my lord.

01:06:52.341 --> 01:06:55.428
He opened
the young master's gate of energy.

01:07:20.995 --> 01:07:23.789
Young Master Jang, are you awake?

01:07:35.926 --> 01:07:37.845
Am I alive or dead?

01:07:39.096 --> 01:07:40.806
You barely made it out alive.

01:07:40.890 --> 01:07:42.433
Master Heo saved you

01:07:43.559 --> 01:07:45.811
by opening your gate of energy.

01:07:48.230 --> 01:07:49.899
He opened it?

01:07:49.982 --> 01:07:51.442
Mu-deok that lunatic

01:07:52.151 --> 01:07:55.154
would not tell us
what kind of poison you took.

01:07:55.237 --> 01:07:59.033
So he had no choice
but to do that to remove the poison.

01:08:03.120 --> 01:08:05.372
I am betting everything on you.

01:08:05.998 --> 01:08:09.168
So I hope you will survive.

01:08:12.171 --> 01:08:13.589
Where is Mu-deok?

01:08:32.608 --> 01:08:33.734
Mu-deok…

01:08:40.407 --> 01:08:41.659
Mu-deok!

01:08:52.211 --> 01:08:53.170
Mu-deok.

01:08:56.674 --> 01:08:57.842
Mu-deok.

01:09:02.346 --> 01:09:03.430
Mu-deok.

01:09:18.028 --> 01:09:19.738
Both of us could have died.

01:09:20.614 --> 01:09:21.740
You are…

01:09:23.075 --> 01:09:24.410
You are really crazy.

01:09:27.580 --> 01:09:29.081
So you survived…

01:09:30.833 --> 01:09:32.209
my pupil.

01:09:38.507 --> 01:09:39.758
That is right.

01:09:41.677 --> 01:09:43.470
I almost died thanks to you.

01:09:50.019 --> 01:09:51.770
My crazy master.

01:11:02.716 --> 01:11:06.845
Uk has opened his gate of energy
in the end.

01:11:06.929 --> 01:11:10.724
Since I survived as promised,
I will serve you as my master.

01:11:10.808 --> 01:11:14.395
In order to become the best mage,
you must go through several steps.

01:11:14.478 --> 01:11:16.855
You are worse than what I had expected.

01:11:16.939 --> 01:11:18.190
We were looking at Yul.

01:11:18.274 --> 01:11:19.566
Mu-deok asked me to come.

01:11:19.650 --> 01:11:21.318
That girl, Mu-deok…

01:11:21.402 --> 01:11:23.612
She seems to be hiding something.

01:11:23.696 --> 01:11:25.447
I am in love with you!

01:11:25.531 --> 01:11:29.535
Young Master!
The prince has come to see you.

01:11:29.618 --> 01:11:31.829
There is another sword here that
you cannot unsheathe.

01:11:31.912 --> 01:11:34.248
It will not bode well for me
if I lose that sword as well.

01:11:34.331 --> 01:11:35.165
It cannot be helped.

01:11:35.249 --> 01:11:37.167
Whoever wins shall take the sword.

01:11:39.169 --> 01:11:44.174
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
